This is the qualified generic interface bundle. It includes core interfaces,
selected concurrent/background-work interfaces and generic runtime correctness
repairs used by the existing qualification. It is not claimed to be the smallest
possible core-only patch. Runtime documentation and unrelated WhatsApp recovery
are excluded. Qualification tests are a separate optional patch. No the agent config,
profile, secrets, home-notice customization or production data is included.
